{
  "id": "001",
  "title": "Self Introduction at Work",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2015-11-12",
  "synopsis": "If you work in China you will probably have to introduce yourself at some point. Here we see an example of a simple self introduction in Chinese.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1/1feb01a6477ed4d18fdaabd142dfd653ffe7e02f.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "自我介绍\n\n    大家好！我叫张亮，今年23岁，来自北京。我喜欢看书，看电影。\n\n    很高兴能和大家一起工作。谢谢大家。",
    "traditional": "自我介紹\n\n    大家好！我叫張亮，今年23歲，來自北京。我喜歡看書，看電影。\n\n    很高興能和大家一起工作。謝謝大家。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Self introduction"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "大家好！",
      "traditional": "大家好！",
      "pinyin": "dà jiā hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "我叫张亮，今年23岁，来自北京。",
      "traditional": "我叫張亮，今年23歲，來自北京。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ jiào zhāng liàng jīn nián 3 suì lái zì běi jīng",
      "english": "Hi everyone!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我喜欢看书，看电影。",
      "traditional": "我喜歡看書，看電影。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xǐ huan kàn shū kàn diàn yǐng",
      "english": "My name is Liang Zhang; I'm 23 years old and come from Beijing."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I like to read and to watch movies."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "很高兴能和大家一起工作。",
      "traditional": "很高興能和大家一起工作。",
      "pinyin": "hěn gāo xìng néng hé dà jiā yì qǐ gōng zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "谢谢大家。",
      "traditional": "謝謝大家。",
      "pinyin": "xiè xie dà jiā",
      "english": "I am very happy to be able to work together with everyone."
    }
  ],
